@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy";
}

<h1>Privacy</h1>

<p>
    This is a simple privacy message for the NailBook project.
    It should be reviewed and updated before the app is used publicly.
</p>

<h2 class="h4 mt-4">Information we store</h2>
<p>
    When you create an account or request an appointment, NailBook stores
    your name, email address, selected service, requested date and time,
    and optional appointment note.
</p>

<h2 class="h4 mt-4">How we use this information</h2>
<p>
    This information is used only to manage your account and appointment
    requests.
</p>

<h2 class="h4 mt-4">Your account</h2>
<p>
    Only authorised administrators can manage services, gallery designs,
    and appointment requests.
</p>

<h2 class="h4 mt-4">Contact</h2>
<p>
    Contact the salon if you have questions about your information.
</p>